  "goodToKnow": "Der Impfgegner (die Impfgegnerin) is an anti-vaxxer. The Impfskeptiker (vaccine-hesitant) are a broader group with doubts. Since 2020, measles vaccination is required for children in Kitas and schools, while a general COVID-19 Impfpflicht failed in the Bundestag in 2022. Impfen means to vaccinate, and der Impfpass is the vaccination record booklet. The plural is the same."
